# <type>[optional scope][optional !]: <English imperative summary>
# Keep the subject within 72 characters; no trailing period.
# Start the summary with a lowercase verb; preserve proper names.
# Types: feat, fix, docs, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
# Optional scopes: desktop, swift, ios, localization
# Example: feat: add Korean and English UI language settings
#
# Optional body after a blank line:
# Explain the problem, resulting behavior, and actual verification.
#
# Optional issue footer: Closes #123
# Breaking changes require ! and a BREAKING CHANGE: impact/migration footer.
